{title: Chehre}
{artist: Harish Verma}
{key: Em}

{c: Verse 1}
[Em]Duniya te [C]lakhan chehre,        [G]Beshak ne [D]fabde ve
[Em]Mere do [C]nain ne kamle [G]har pal,        Tainu [D]labde ve
[Em]Tere wich rehn gawache,        [C]Yaadan de [D]ghere ve [Em]
[Em]Jina tu [C]khud wich sajjna,        [G]Ona e [D]wich mere ve
[Em]Kanan nu [C]chad gayi masti,        [G]Sun ke tere [D]bol soneya
[Em]Rab nu tak [C]lawaan nerheyo,        [G]Behke tere [D]kol soneya
[Em]Kardishingar jadon,        [Em]Kardi shingar jadon
[C]Sheesha mainu [D]chhede ve [Em],        [Em]Jina tu [C]khud wich sajjna
[G]Ona e [D]wich mere ve,        [Em]Jina tu [C]khud wich sajjna
[G]Ona e [D]wich mere ve,        [Em]Jina tu [C]khud wich [Em]sajjna
[Em]Teri ae [C]adaa niraali,        [G]Kehke koi [D]gal te hasna
[Em]Kadd ke meri [C]jaan lai jaawe,        [G]Aukha ho jaawe [D]bachna
[Em]Mainu hunar sikhaade,        [C]Aunde tainu [D]jede ve [Em]
[Em]Jina tu [C]khud wich sajjna,        [G]Ona e [D]wich mere ve
[Em]Jina tu [C]khud wich sajjna,        [G]Ona e [D]wich mere ve
[Em]Jina tu [C]khud wich [G]sajjna,        [Em]Sandhu [C]kuldeep main rab ton
[G]Mandi haan [D]nit duavan,        [Em]Vaalan [C]de cheer ch suha
[G]Rang main tere pyar [D]da pawaan,        [Em]Goree mere pair di jhanjar
[Em]Gore mere pair di jhanjar,        [C]Chhan?ku tere [D]vehde ve [Em]
[Em]Jina tu [C]khud wich sajjna,        [G]Ona e [D]wich mere ve
[Em]Jina tu [C]khud wich [Em]sajjna
